(map thumping)
- This is Putin's war

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.630
seven months on.
(dramatic music)

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:11.103
I've been looking at this map
every day, tracking this war.

00:00:11.103 --> 00:00:12.660
This war that has led
to seven million people

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.830
