00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.440
- What I thought this map might look like,

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.480
and I wanna compare it to
how it's actually played out.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.590
I've been watching the video I made

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.390
from right before the invasion,

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.030
remembering a world where
this hadn't happened yet.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.280
I'm not sure that he's
gonna invade tomorrow,

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.750
but he very well could.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.250
So let me quickly get you up to speed

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.100
on what seven months of
war has meant for Ukraine,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.650
to show you what the new
strategy is for Russia

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.720
and who's actually winning this conflict.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:55.170
- [Presenter] Russian troops
are moving in (indistinct)

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:00.540
- Hey, pause really quick.

