00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:50.400
Okay, let's get back to another
very important global issue,

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.636
the war in Ukraine.

00:02:51.636 --> 00:02:53.374
(jet engine roaring)

00:02:53.374 --> 00:02:54.647
(missile explosion)

00:02:54.647 --> 00:02:56.400
(people speaking in foreign language)

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.110
- Okay, quick reminder that this invasion

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.930
that happened in February
was really just an escalation

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.150
of a war that's been going on over here

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.467
in the eastern part of
Ukraine for eight years.

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:05.490
- [Presenter] The Russian military

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.570
now being directly involved

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.070
in fighting Ukrainian government forces.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:09.510
- [Presenter] Russian troops spreading out

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:12.371
throughout the strategic
Crimean peninsula.

00:03:12.371 --> 00:03:13.204
(Putin speaking in foreign language)

00:03:13.204 --> 00:03:14.910
- It was back in 2014 that Putin invaded

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.650
and occupied and then annexed,

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:19.470
which basically just
means stole this peninsula

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.370
called Crimea.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.370
That sparked a war that has
been going on in this region,

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.350
the Donbass region for eight years,

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.810
where Ukrainians who
sympathized with Russia,

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.021
rose up trying to fight to
become a part of Russia.

00:03:31.021 --> 00:03:34.980
(Putin speaking Russian)

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.380
- And then, as we all
know, earlier this year,

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.747
I mean, you know what happened.

00:03:38.747 --> 00:03:41.130
(ominous music)

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.020
Putin moved in from all sides,

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:44.700
except for the West, of course.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:48.270
His big goal was to swiftly
take the capital of Kyiv.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.660
You gotta take the capital if
you want to win a war quickly.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.740
The scariest images

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.480
at the beginning of the
war if you remember,

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.640
were these 60 kilometer long convoys

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.910
of Russian military
vehicles in these huge lines

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.830
moving towards the capital.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.120
60 kilometers long.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.710
I mean, these images were so striking.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:07.110
I frankly thought Putin was
gonna be victorious in this.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.490
I thought he was going
to take the capital.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:11.100
But this plan very much did not work.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.100
- We are seeing Russians
slowly getting closer to Kyiv.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:14.940
- [Presenter] Ukrainian forces

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.700
are continuing to hold their
capital from the Russians.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.620
- This was Putin's first
big miscalculation.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.380
He way overestimated his troops' ability

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.200
and way underestimated
the response of Ukrainians

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.770
and the West who pumped loads
of weapons into the country

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:29.610
to help them fight.

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:31.767
Not only did the Russian
army fail to take Kyiv,

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:34.680
the Ukrainian army
mounted a very effective

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.780
counter offensive and pushed Russia

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.820
out of all of this territory

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.010
in the course of just a few weeks.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.600
After this giant defeat,

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:45.420
Putin calls all of his
troops back to regroup

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.540
and to focus on a more
narrow front of the war.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.160
Sticking to over here,

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.740
the plan was now to continue to liberate

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.120
the eastern regions of the country

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.610
that already had a lot of
pro Russian separatists,

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.920
who again, had been fighting
here for eight years.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.120
And as the summer approached,

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.910
I think this is where a lot
of us like started to tune out

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:06.330
because the war turned into
a long protracted stalemate,

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.280
with some occasional Russian gains

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.770
and a few counter offensive
from the Ukrainians.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:14.250
The term we need to use
here is war of attrition.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.620
Basically, who can wear
down the other first

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.720
through destruction and endurance.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.550
This is a horrible way to fight a war.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.280
And while Putin's attempt
to take over Kyiv failed,

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.690
He didn't fail in taking over

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.463
other major population centers.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.460
Like here in Kherson,

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.710
which was the first major
city to fall to Russia

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.733
after the invasion.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:36.813
- The battle for Kherson in
particular is intensifying.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.940
- Watching how they treat
their first conquered city

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.710
is a really good indicator

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.510
of what Russia's real goal is here.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.890
They didn't just occupy the city,

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:49.260
they got busy turning it into Russia.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.670
They took down the Ukrainian flag

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:51.720
and replaced it with a Russian one.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.660
They put up these creepy
billboards with like young children

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.550
about Russia being one people,

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:59.010
and Russia is quote, "here forever,"

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:01.410
like super on the nose on
what they're trying to do.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.350
The brave people of Kherson
gathered and protested

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.750
like right next to Russian tanks,

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.460
but they didn't stop
the Russians from doing

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.710
what they clearly had been
planning this whole time.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.810
On May 1st, Russia
announced that these people

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.340
would start using the Russian ruble,

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.510
like the Russian currency.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.280
They seized control of the broadcasting

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.300
and internet channels

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.140
and stopped these people

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.580
from being able to connect with the world.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.660
These events are a big deal

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:25.380
because Putin said he was
invading to liberate these people,

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:28.110
a special military operation,
not to conquer them.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.090
Putin was unable to oust the government

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.100
and initiate a regime change

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:32.940
to put in a government

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.800
that would've been more
friendly to Russia.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.920
So now it looks like he's gonna
try to gobble up the country

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.320
from the east piece by piece.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.234
And the keyword here is annex.

00:06:43.234 --> 00:06:44.067
(missile launching)

00:06:44.067 --> 00:06:46.380
- Russia has launched an
intense ground campaign

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.110
to capture a key Ukrainian city

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:49.650
in the Eastern Donbass region.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.350
- Annex is a super benign
like technical word,

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.770
but it means to conquer
land to then occupy it,

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:57.390
and then to just unilaterally declare

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.910
that this land is a part
of our sovereign territory.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.830
No treaties, no nothing,

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.450
just a unilateral land grab.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.100
So let's rewind to the
beginning of the war.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.830
Watch how at the beginning it
was all about this invasion

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.170
from all three sides, a
very aggressive invasion,

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.120
again with the focus on the capital.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.100
But once Russia got kicked out of Kyiv,

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.737
the war really starts to
become focused on all of this.

00:07:16.737 --> 00:07:18.180
But Russia made progress.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:20.370
They took over all of
these population centers

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.480
here in the Donbass region,

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.350
and by the end of April,

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.650
it was starting to become
clear what the next move was.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:28.260
It came out in Russian
media in this report

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.570
that a senior Russian military official

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:33.577
said that the next phase
of the operation was quote,

00:07:33.577 --> 00:07:36.570
"To establish full
control over the Donbass

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.583
and Southern Ukraine regions.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.390
And then he says it point blank,

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.770
he says that this will allow Russia

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.160
to establish a land bridge
from mainland Russia

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.810
all the way to Crimea,

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.660
this peninsula that
Russia annexed in 2014.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:52.710
But why stop there?

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.200
This Russian military
commander then infers

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.430
that the next part of the plan

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.250
is to create that land bridge even further

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.930
all the way to Transnistria,

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.330
this little sliver of a pretend country

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.890
that basically no one recognizes

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.780
and that should be a part of Moldova,

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.580
but that is full of Russian soldiers

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:11.610
and a bunch of people who
want Russia to annex them.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.320
Establishing this part of the land bridge

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.550
would be pretty difficult,

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.950
because it would mean a battle in Odesa,

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.350
which is Ukraine's third largest city.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.550
There'd be a horrible fight,

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.380
so let's just hope that part of the plan

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.700
does not come to fruition.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.860
But Russia has been successful

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.290
in deeply establishing this land bridge

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.990
between their country and Crimea,

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.990
but to do that, they had to
fight a very bloody battle

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.850
in the port city of Mariupol.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.431
- [Presenter] We begin tonight
with the battle for Mariupol.

00:08:38.431 --> 00:08:39.540
- [Presenter] The mayor of Mariupol

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.700
is calling on residents to evacuate.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.470
- After an egregious few weeks,

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.030
Russia finally took over the city.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.370
- [Presenter] Thousands of
civilians remain in Mariupol.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.380
- So yeah, that's the phase of the war

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.820
that we are in right now.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.680
More and more evidence is mounting

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.870
that Russia isn't just planning to occupy

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.790
and liberate these people,

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:59.490
but to actually annex them
to be a part of Russia.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.870
US intelligence reports claim

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.850
that Russia is installing
Russian officials

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.710
to lead these cities and regions.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.110
They're creating these fast
tracks for Russian citizenship

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.540
and making it so that all new
babies born in these regions

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.550
are automatically Russian citizens.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.010
Any day now they're
gonna hold fake elections

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.050
to gauge if the people want to be Russian.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.280
And when you look at the results,

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.750
you're gonna see that somehow

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.930
a ridiculously giant
number of people voted yes.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.700
This is their annexation playbook.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.920
They've done it before and it's worked,

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.690
and it looks like they're doing it again.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.910
- Annexation by force
would be a gross violation

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.230
of the UN charter

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.960
and we will not allow it to
go unchallenged or unpunished.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.940
- But the Ukrainians are fighting back.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.740
They have not surrendered to this army

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.230
that is way more powerful than they are.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.700
As we're making this video,

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.273
there is a giant counter
offensive happening up here,

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:50.190
and the Ukrainian army is
taking back huge swaths of land.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.390
The New York Times pointed out

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.880
that Ukraine captured
more territory in a week

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.670
than Russia had captured in five months.

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:59.220
If you watch the videos
of the Ukrainian soldiers

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:02.070
liberating these cities,
it's pretty emotional.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:04.860
And if we're looking at the
map thinking strategically,

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.470
it's an important reminder
of what the spokesperson

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.270
of the US National Security Council said.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.920
- And we would remind Mr. Putin

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.190
that over time may prove
unable to hold this territory.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.860
- And this gets to the last
point I want to make here.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.650
I'm here to argue that he's already lost.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:23.070
Back at the beginning of this
war I made this prediction

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:24.780
thinking that Putin
was gonna be successful

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.270
in taking the capital and
overthrowing the government.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:30.330
All logic pointed that he
was capable of doing that,

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.130
but he clearly did not.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:32.963
I was wrong.

00:10:32.963 --> 00:10:36.030
Instead, Putin has been able
to control a few strips of land

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.920
in the east and the south.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.430
He's got his landbridge to
Crimea and he may keep going,

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:44.100
but again, Putin's war,
the motive and the goal

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.860
is based on some pretty giant delusions,

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:49.830
chief among them that he
is liberating these people

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.110
who are ready to come
back to the Russian flock.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.550
That is not what is happening

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:56.277
and we have seven months
worth of war to prove it.

00:10:56.277 --> 00:10:58.860
(upbeat music)

